    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overview:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Life Garden&quot; is a unique life simulation game where you paint each day of your life with flowers and grass. In this poetic journey, you'll witness the flow of time, record life's moments, and cultivate your own garden of the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game - it's a mirror reflecting life, a diary recording growth, and a garden preserving memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Flowers of Life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plant a flower or grass for each day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Record your daily mood through different plants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Watch your life garden bloom with time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Soul Diary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Write personal diaries for special days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Document life's precious moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Reflect on the past and look to the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Time Imprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Visualize your life journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience the flow and accumulation of time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cherish the present and plan for the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Achievement System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Set personal goals and track progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock unique achievements and milestones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gain a sense of accomplishment in growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Healing Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Clean and elegant interface design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing and joyful interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive mental relaxation time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Multi-language Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Supports Chinese, English, Japanese, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Accessible global experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Connect with players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is perfect for anyone who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Wants to record life's moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Seeks inner peace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Loves life planning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoys collecting achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pursues spiritual growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own life garden and let each day bloom with your unique colors.</p>",
